	"name": "Giant Swing",
	"type": "maneuver",
	"img": "icons/magic/control/debuff-energy-hold-levitate-green.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Planting your feet, you swing your enemy into his friend, slamming them both painfully. While grappling a creature, you may use them as an improvised weapon that you are proficient with against a creature within 5ft of you. On a successful hit, you deal 1d10 + Strength bludgeoning damage to both your target and your improvised weapon. When you take this action you may make this attack, plus any additional attacks from extra attack.</p>",
